첫날 우리는 그 오래된 항구를 구경했어요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">Am</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">ersten</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">wir</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">besichtigt.</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">alten</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">den</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">Hafen</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"7\">Tag</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"8\">haben</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Am ersten Tag haben wir den alten Hafen besichtigt.</b></div>am ersten Tag은 3격이라 -en, den alten Hafen은 남성 4격이라 -en이에요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">도전</span><span class=\"sub-title\">도전 문제 · 함정과 예외까지 따져 봐요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">25.</strong> 틀린 문장을 고르세요.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Das Wetter in dieser kleinen Stadt ist oft schlecht.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) Die Kinder spielen mit dem kleinen Katze.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Mit der netten Verkäuferin habe ich lange gesprochen.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Welche bequemen Schuhe ziehst du an?</button></div><div class=\"qe\">Katze는 여성이라서 mit der kleinen Katze예요. 어미 -en은 맞지만 관사가 틀렸어요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;hohe&quot;],[&quot;langen&quot;],[&quot;dunklen&quot;],[&quot;teuren&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">26.</strong> Das <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(hoch)</span> Haus am Ende der <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(lang)</span> Straße gehört Frau Berger. Im <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:9ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 3\"><span class=\"qh\">(dunkel)</span> Keller stehen die <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 4\"><span class=\"qh\">(teuer)</span> Weinflaschen.</div><div class=\"qko\">긴 길 끝에 있는 그 높은 집은 베르거 부인의 집이에요. 어두운 지하실에는 비싼 포도주병들이 있어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Das <b>hohe</b> Haus am Ende der <b>langen</b> Straße gehört Frau Berger. Im <b>dunklen</b> Keller stehen die <b>teuren</b> Weinflaschen.</div>das hohe(중성 1격 -e, c 탈락) · der langen(2격 -en) · im dunklen(3격 -en, e 탈락) · die teuren(복수 -en, e 탈락).</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">27.</strong> schön의 어미가 나머지와 다른 것은?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) wegen des ___ Wetters</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) durch die ___ Wälder</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) für die ___ Freundin</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) bei dem ___ Nachbarn</button></div><div class=\"qe\">für die schöne Freundin은 여성 4격이라 -e예요.<br>나머지는 3격·복수·2격이라 모두 -en이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;hohen&quot;],[&quot;Wiener&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">28.</strong> Auf den <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(hoch)</span> Dächern der <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(Wien + -er)</span> Altstadt sitzen viele Tauben.</div><div class=\"qko\">빈 구시가지의 높은 지붕들 위에 비둘기가 많이 앉아 있어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Auf den <b>hohen</b> Dächern der <b>Wiener</b> Altstadt sitzen viele Tauben.</div>den hohen Dächern — 복수 3격 -en, hoch → hoh-.<br>Wiener는 도시 이름 + -er라서 어미가 없어요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">29.</strong> 바르게 쓴 것은?</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) in dem dunkeln Zimmer</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) der rosa Rock</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) das hoche Gebäude</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) den hohe Turm</button></div><div class=\"qe\">rosa·lila는 어미를 붙이지 않아요.<br>hoch → das hohe Gebäude · den hohen Turm, dunkel → in dem dunklen Zimmer(e가 빠지고 3격 -en).</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;langen&quot;],[&quot;schwarzen&quot;],[&quot;rosa&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">30.</strong> A: Welchen <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(lang)</span> Mantel meinst du?<br>B: Den <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:11ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(schwarz)</span> dort, neben der <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:6ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 3\"><span class=\"qh\">(rosa)</span> Jacke.</div><div class=\"qko\">A: 어느 긴 코트 말이야?<br>B: 저기 분홍색 재킷 옆에 있는 검은 거.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · A: Welchen <b>langen</b> Mantel meinst du?<br>B: Den <b>schwarzen</b> dort, neben der <b>rosa</b> Jacke.</div>welchen(남성 4격) 뒤 → -en. 명사 Mantel을 빼도 어미는 그대로 -en이에요.<br>rosa는 어미가 없어요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"qscore\" data-total=\"30\" data-no-print><div class=\"qscore-t\">맞힌 문제 <b class=\"qscore-n\">0</b> / 30</div><div class=\"qscore-bar\"><i></i></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"all\">모두 다시 풀기</button></div>\n<div class=\"brand-foot\"><img src=\"%%A0%%\" alt=\"Sophia Deutsch Akademie\" class=\"foot-logo\"><div class=\"foot-name\">Sophia Deutsch Akademie</div><div class=\"foot-tag\">Innovative Learning Beyond the Traditional</div></div>"